# Files executed on Linux must keep LF endings regardless of the committing
# machine's core.autocrlf. A CRLF Dockerfile passes a trailing \r into the
# shell-form CMD — uvicorn then gets "65\r" as a number and the container
# fails to start on Cloud Run.
api/Dockerfile   text eol=lf
.dockerignore    text eol=lf
*.sh             text eol=lf
*.sql            text eol=lf
